<div id="article_show_text">Tutorials are important to help new users and are an easy yet rewarding way of sharing knowledge.<br><br>We opened a <a href="http://rawtherapee.com/forum/viewforum.php?f=15">dedicated forum section</a> and encourage everyone to submit tutorials. Requirements are described in the <a href="http://rawtherapee.com/forum/viewtopic.php?f=15&amp;t=4143">instructions</a>, please read them before posting. Finished, high quality tutorials will be announced in the news too.<br><br>Happy contribution!<br></div>

